{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1359","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Modular Stability"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We define $$$x \\bmod y$$$ as the remainder of division of $$$x$$$ by $$$y$$$ ($$$\\%$$$ operator in C++ or Java, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mod"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" operator in Pascal)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call an array of positive integers $$$[a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_k]$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if for every permutation $$$p$$$ of integers from $$$1$$$ to $$$k$$$, and for every non-negative integer $$$x$$$, the following condition is met:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$ (((x \\bmod a_1) \\bmod a_2) \\dots \\bmod a_{k - 1}) \\bmod a_k = (((x \\bmod a_{p_1}) \\bmod a_{p_2}) \\dots \\bmod a_{p_{k - 1}}) \\bmod a_{p_k} $$$ "}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"That is, for each non-negative integer $$$x$$$, the value of $$$(((x \\bmod a_1) \\bmod a_2) \\dots \\bmod a_{k - 1}) \\bmod a_k$$$ does not change if we reorder the elements of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For two given integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$, calculate the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" arrays $$$[a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_k]$$$ such that $$$1 \\le a_1 \\lt a_2 \\lt \\dots \\lt a_k \\le n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, k \\le 5 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer — the number of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"stable"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" arrays $$$[a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_k]$$$ such that $$$1 \\le a_1 \\lt a_2 \\lt \\dots \\lt a_k \\le n$$$. Since the answer may be large, print it modulo $$$998244353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n16\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 7\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1337 42\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n95147305\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n500000 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n500000\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1359E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1359/problem/E"}